flowchart TD
    A[Domain: finite word / state table] --> B[Equal-LEN stack: fuse A,B to A,A XOR B]
    B --> C[Difference coefficients a_S]
    C --> D[M again: exact value table]
    C --> E[ANF evaluation at reader address]

    subgraph BBP[BBP layer: rational-ring lanes]
      R[Residue r = 16^m mod (8k+j)] --> Q[Digit q_j = floor(16*r / d)]
      Q --> T[4 lane digits q1,q4,q5,q6]
      E -->|compiled 16-bit lane fold| V[4q1 - 2q4 - q5 - q6]
      T --> V
      V --> COL[Accumulate contributions by global column]
      COL --> GC[Global column carry: finite run -23..37]
      GC --> PI[64 π hex digits]
      J[Layer-local J_k(m)] --> JB[Bounded -4..3; H = w + 16J - J_next]
    end

    subgraph SHA[SHA-256: local difference operators composed through the round]
      G1[Truth table Ch] --> M1[ANF Ch]
      G2[Truth table Maj] --> M2[ANF Maj]
      G3[Truth table full adder/subtractor] --> M3[ANF FA/FS]
      M1 --> W[32-bit compiled word operators]
      M2 --> W
      M3 --> W
      W --> RND[64 nested SHA rounds; W_t,K_t drive each round]
      RND --> FF[Feed-forward H + E]
      RND --> INV[Reverse rounds with known W_t,K_t]
      INV --> HOME[Recover parent chaining state]
      RND --> ST[Difference table after every round on LEN=8 reader slice]
      ST --> SAT[Full monomial support round 3; max derivative entropy round 4]
    end
